Product Backlog: 

Create product vision: Define the problem and SDG connection to the clinic appointment system
Create user stories: system requirements according to different perspectives of users which are students, clinic staff and admins.
Create product backlog: List of all tasks 
Create use-case diagrams: modelling interactions between users and the system
Create class diagram: Define the system structure + relationships between classes 
Design UI wireframes: Sketch the interface screens( Login , dashboard and booking page)
Develop early prototype: Creating an initial version 
Implement appointment booking : Allow students to book the appointments online 
Implement appointment cancellation: allow users to cancel existing appointments \
Implement appointment rescheduling: Allow users to change any existing appointments times 
Implement staff appointment management: Allow clinic staff to manage appointments 
Implement admin user management: Allow admin to manage system users
Create testing plan: Creating objective and test cases 
Conduct usability testing: Evaluate the system actual usability with users 
Record test results: document outcomes of the planned test cases 
Collect user feedback: Gather feedback from users about the system usability 
Prepare final report
Prepare presentation slides 
